{
  "schema": "calcdb.question/1",
  "probe": "r-q-expr-sql/domain-txn-visibility",
  "bookRefs": [
    "R-EXPR-1",
    "EXPR-DOMAIN"
  ],
  "description": "EXPR-DOMAIN, deciding variants: what a domain function sees of an uncommitted row, an edit buffer and a rolled-back row inside one Workspace. Dtx(id) is created; DCount('*', 'Dtx') is read at baseline; BeginTrans on Workspaces(0), INSERT id 1, DCount; Rollback, DCount; BeginTrans, INSERT id 2, CommitTrans, DCount; a dynaset AddNew with id = 50 is read through DCount before and after its Update. Follow-up probe (status F) for EXPR-DOMAIN; runs on a writable fresh copy of fixture r-q-expr-sql-main through DAO.DBEngine.120; each recordset reads Name, Type and Value of every field. Each statement is preceded by a marker (a DROP TABLE of a table that does not exist, which always fails), so DBEngine.Errors read after the statement shows that statement's own failure or the marker's, never an older one.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
    "clearErrorInfoBefore",
    "excepinfo",
    "deferredFill",
    "errorInfo"
  ],
